 "title": "Crushed Bass",
 "category": "Bass",
 "text": "Sound: a gritty, broken, digital bass: lo-fi crunch and whining aliasing on a low saw, for industrial and breakbeat.\n\nHow it's built: a saw and a pulse through the Ladder filter (with a little envelope), then the Crusher: 6 bits and a quarter of the sample rate, which adds steps and ringing alias tones; Drive on top. One voice.\n\nPlay: low riffs. Higher notes alias more.\n\nTweak: BITS and RATE on the Crusher, the filter's CUTOFF (before the crusher, so a darker input still crushes), DRIVE.",
